<h2>AI Script Generator</h2>
  <p>We provide a service that generates computer code from a prompt</p>
Script-gen.AI
Interactive Linux Distribution Engineering, Scripting & Educational Platform

Script-gen.AI is a highly specialized, interactive engineering dashboard designed for Linux systems administration, script generation, and core architectural learning. Rather than treating Linux as a generic target, the platform isolates specific distributions down to their native package managers, init systems, and shell environments.

It functions simultaneously as an automation tool and an educational simulator, helping users understand why code changes across environments while providing safe execution previews.
🛠 Platform Matrix & Features

The interface is structured into four distinct focus modules, driving precision from high-level system logic down to bare-metal compilation:
1. Dedicated Linux Distribution Selection

    Distro-Specific Tuning: Tailor output logic explicitly for target environments like Ubuntu, Fedora, Arch, Debian, or enterprise flavors.

    Environment Matching: Automatically swaps package management syntax (e.g., apt, dnf, pacman), repository configurations, and directory structures based on the selected distribution.

2. Multi-Language Code Compilation

    Select the native execution or scripting language best suited for the administration task:

        Shell Scripting: Bash, SH, Zsh templates optimized for compliance.

        System Languages: C Source infrastructure modules, Python automation scripts, or web utility frameworks.

3. Comprehensive File Layer Matrix

    Systemd Integration: Generate, analyze, and troubleshoot custom .service unit files for background process orchestration.

    Network Infrastructure: Build structured Nginx configurations, reverse proxy maps, and upstream load-balancing pools.

    Automation Automation: Compile raw configurations, deployment manifests, and automation directory trees.

4. Interactive Learning & Feedback Engine

    Educational Code Explanations: Real-time analysis breakdowns of the generated code strings to teach system commands, permissions, and security practices.

    Terminal UI Simulation: A built-in console environment that streams real-time logs, compilation statuses, and dry-run outputs.

    Resource Optimization Toggles: Settings to configure logging levels, error trapping routines, and performance throttling to observe how changes impact execution.

🗄 Backend Architecture (Supabase Integration)

The application utilizes Supabase to back its states and data security layer:

    Session & Progress Tracking: Saves user configurations, custom distro combinations, and educational history modules securely.

    Data Sovereignty & Encryption: Mapped entirely via secure database instances utilizing AES-256 encryption. All subprocessor endpoints strictly process data under isolated user parameter scopes to keep your proprietary architectures and custom scripts completely private.

🚀 Getting Started (Local Development Deployment)

To run Script-gen.AI entirely offline—bypassing cloud constraints, rate limits, and corporate censorship layers—deploy the package locally.
